    old "Aha ha! Nicely done—you've been neatly outwitted there, little noble lass!{#sp91_s1835_015}"
    new "А-ха-ха! Тебя ловко переиграли, знатная девчонка!"

    old "S-Shut up! What's with you two, making fun of me?!{#sp91_s1835_017}"
